{"type":"message","id":"f342fa01","parentId":"075b83f0","timestamp":"2026-04-20T19:07:38.335Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-04-20 19:07 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 47 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:2-2, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:4-4, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:5-5; note: reflection\n- Possible Lasting Truths: Possible Lasting Truths: No strong candidate truths surfaced. [confidence=0.58 evidence=memory/2026-04-14.md:209-209]; Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 35 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11\n- User: Conversation info (untrusted metadata): ```json { \"message_id\": \"openclaw-weixin:1776664035276-5f69f14f\", \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-20 05:47 UTC\" } ``` 哼，要夸夸我 有人要我夸夸她的设计，来，你给我夸一下\n- Assistant: 主公，此乃佳话。待我细察其设计，便以军师之才，剖析其精妙之处。 容我先观此设计之形态。\n- 事件: Codus Agent 在执行 React Demo 构建任务时频繁出现通用错误提示：\n- 事件: ⚠️ Something went wrong while processing your request. Please try again, or use /new to start a fresh session.\n- 根因分析: **问题本质**：API 配额超限（429 错误）; **错误信息**：\n- 根因分析: 429 You have exceeded the 5-hour usage quota. It will reset at 2026-04-12 17:33:06 +0800 CST.\n- 根因分析: **涉及模型**：`doubao-seed-2.0-code`、`glm-4.7`、`minimax-2.5`; **触发场景**：Codus 执行 `npm install` 安装依赖时调用工具\n- 影响范围: **Agent**：Codus（Feishu 会话：agent:codus:feishu:codus:direct:ou_13190b75af6c015cd2975d6de047a6f1）; **状态**：主会话 failed，子会话已完成; **已完成工作**：95%（项目结构、所有组件、配置文件）; **未完成工作**：最终 `npm install` 和构建\n- Reflections: Theme: `assistant` kept surfacing across 35 memories.; confidence: 1.00; evidence: memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:2-2, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:4-4, memory/.dreams/session-corpus/2026-04-11.txt:5-5; note: reflection\n- Possible Lasting Truths: No strong candidate truths surfaced.\n\nRecur